bug fixes:
* fixed Windows isNull() implementation to return correct result
* fixed Windows compare() implementation to return comparison result
* fixed memory leak in static UUID::get() for OSSP UUID library
* fixed configure macro mismatch for HAVE_UUID_UNPARSE_CASE
* updated minimum Qore version requirement to 0.9
* improved test coverage with negative tests and corner cases
* updated GitLab CI configuration

